{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "指数型极限", "等价无穷小"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "设 $u=e^x+ax^2+bx-1$，则原式为 $\\lim_{x\\to0}(1+u)^{1/x^2}$。要使极限为 $1$，需\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{u}{x^2}=0.\n$$\n先由\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{e^x+ax^2+bx-1}{x}=1+b=0\n$$\n得 $b=-1$。再代回，\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{e^x-x+ax^2-1}{x^2}=\\frac12+a=0,\n$$\n故 $a=-\\dfrac12$。选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["导数定义", "可导性", "分段与绝对值函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "由导数定义逐项判断。\n选项 A、B 有\n$$\n\\frac{f(x)-f(0)}{x}\\to0.\n$$\n选项 C 中\n$$\n\\cos|x|-1\\sim-\\frac{|x|^2}{2},\n$$\n故商仍趋于 $0$。而 D 中\n$$\n\\cos\\sqrt{|x|}-1\\sim-\\frac{|x|}{2},\n$$\n于是\n$$\n\\frac{\\cos\\sqrt{|x|}-1}{x}\\sim-\\frac{|x|}{2x}\n$$\n左右极限不相等，不可导。选 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["分段函数", "连续性", "参数讨论"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "有\n$$\nf(x)+g(x)=\n\\begin{cases}\n1-ax,& x\\le -1,\\\\\nx-1,& -1<x<0,\\\\\nx+1-b,& x\\ge 0.\n\\end{cases}\n$$\n在 $x=-1$ 处连续给出\n$$\n1+a=-2 \\Rightarrow a=-3.\n$$\n在 $x=0$ 处连续给出\n$$\n-1=1-b \\Rightarrow b=2.\n$$\n选 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["凸函数", "积分不等式", "泰勒展开"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "取 $f(x)=x-\\dfrac12$ 或 $f(x)=\\dfrac12-x$ 可排除 A、C。若 $f''(x)>0$，则在 $x=\\dfrac12$ 处作泰勒展开：\n$$\nf(x)=f\\!\\left(\\frac12\\right)+f'\\!\\left(\\frac12\\right)\\left(x-\\frac12\\right)+\\frac{f''(\\xi)}{2}\\left(x-\\frac12\\right)^2.\n$$\n因为 $f''(\\xi)>0$，故\n$$\nf(x)>f\\!\\left(\\frac12\\right)+f'\\!\\left(\\frac12\\right)\\left(x-\\frac12\\right).\n$$\n两边在 $[0,1]$ 上积分，利用 $\\int_0^1 f(x)\\,dx=0$ 且 $\\int_0^1(x-\\frac12)\\,dx=0$，得\n$$\n0>f\\!\\left(\\frac12\\right).\n$$\n选 D。", "methods": ["泰勒展开"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分比较", "奇偶性", "不等式"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "化简\n$$\nM=\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\left(1+\\frac{2x}{1+x^2}\\right)dx=\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}1\\,dx=\\pi.\n$$\n因为 $e^x>1+x$，所以\n$$\nN=\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\frac{1+x}{e^x}\\,dx<\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}1\\,dx=\\pi=M.\n$$\n又因 $1+\\sqrt{\\cos x}>1$，故\n$$\nK>\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}1\\,dx=\\pi=M.\n$$\n所以 $K>M>N$，选 C。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二重积分", "区域对称性", "积分计算"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "积分区域为\n$$\nD=\\{(x,y)\\mid -1\\le x\\le0,\\ -x\\le y\\le2-x^2\\}\\cup\\{(x,y)\\mid 0\\le x\\le1,\\ x\\le y\\le2-x^2\\}.\n$$\n其中 $xy$ 关于 $x$ 为奇函数，区域关于 $y$ 轴对称，因此奇部积分为 $0$。原式化为\n$$\n2\\int_0^1dx\\int_x^{2-x^2}1\\,dy\n=2\\int_0^1(2-x^2-x)\\,dx=\\frac73.\n$$\n选 C。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["矩阵相似", "Jordan块", "相似变换"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "取\n$$\nP=\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&-1&0\\\\\n0&1&0\\\\\n0&0&1\n\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad\nP^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&1&0\\\\\n0&1&0\\\\\n0&0&1\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n直接计算得\n$$\nP^{-1}\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&1&-1\\\\\n0&1&1\\\\\n0&0&1\n\\end{pmatrix}P=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&1&0\\\\\n0&1&1\\\\\n0&0&1\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n故选 A。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["矩阵秩", "分块矩阵", "反例法"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "选项 C 显然不对，秩一般满足的是上、下界而不是恒等于最大值。选项 B、D 均可构造反例否定。对 A，\n$$\n(A,AB)=A(E,B),\n$$\n右乘分块不增加超出 $A$ 列空间的部分，因此\n$$\nr(A,AB)=r(A).\n$$\n故选 A。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "拉格朗日中值定理", "反三角函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "1", "explanation": "由拉格朗日中值定理，存在 $\\xi\\in(x,x+1)$ 使\n$$\n\\arctan(x+1)-\\arctan x=\\frac{1}{1+\\xi^2}.\n$$\n所以\n$$\nx^2[\\arctan(x+1)-\\arctan x]=\\frac{x^2}{1+\\xi^2}\\to1.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["拐点", "切线方程", "导数应用"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$y=4x-3$", "explanation": "$$\ny'=2x+\\frac{2}{x},\\qquad y''=2-\\frac{2}{x^2}.\n$$\n令 $y''=0$ 得 $x=1$，对应点为 $(1,1)$。此时斜率\n$$\ny'(1)=4,\n$$\n切线方程为\n$$\ny-1=4(x-1),\n$$\n即 $y=4x-3$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["反常积分", "部分分式"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac12\\ln2$", "explanation": "分解\n$$\n\\frac{1}{x^2-4x+3}=\\frac12\\left(\\frac{1}{x-3}-\\frac{1}{x-1}\\right).\n$$\n因而\n$$\n\\int_5^{+\\infty}\\frac{1}{x^2-4x+3}\\,dx\n=\\frac12\\ln\\left|\\frac{x-3}{x-1}\\right|\\Bigg|_5^{+\\infty}\n=\\frac12\\ln2.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["参数方程", "曲率"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac23$", "explanation": "先求\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{dy/dt}{dx/dt}=-\\tan t,\n$$\n进而\n$$\n\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=\\frac{1}{3\\cos^4 t\\sin t}.\n$$\n当 $t=\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}$ 时，\n$$\ny'=-1,\\qquad y''=\\frac{4\\sqrt2}{3}.\n$$\n曲率\n$$\nk=\\frac{|y''|}{[1+(y')^2]^{3/2}}=\\frac{2}{3}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["偏导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac14$", "explanation": "由题设在 $(x,y)=\\left(2,\\dfrac12\\right)$ 时有 $xy=1$，代入可得 $z=1$。令\n$$\nF(x,y,z)=\\ln z+e^{z-1}-xy=0.\n$$\n则\n$$\nF_x=-y,\\qquad F_z=\\frac1z+e^{z-1}.\n$$\n所以\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}=-\\frac{F_x}{F_z}\n=\\frac{y}{1/z+e^{z-1}}.\n$$\n在 $\\left(2,\\dfrac12,1\\right)$ 处得 $\\dfrac14$。", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["特征值", "线性变换", "基下矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "2", "explanation": "在基 $(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3)$ 下，$A$ 的矩阵为\n$$\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n2&0&0\\\\\n1&1&-1\\\\\n1&2&1\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n行列式与基无关，所以\n$$\n|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}\n2&0&0\\\\\n1&1&-1\\\\\n1&2&1\n\\end{vmatrix}=2.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$$\n\\frac12\\left[e^{2x}\\arctan\\sqrt{e^x-1}-\\frac13\\left(\\sqrt{e^x-1}\\right)^3+\\sqrt{e^x-1}\\right]+C.\n$$", "explanation": "记\n$$\nI=\\int e^{2x}\\arctan\\sqrt{e^x-1}\\,dx.\n$$\n分部积分，取\n$$\nu=\\arctan\\sqrt{e^x-1},\\qquad dv=e^{2x}dx,\n$$\n则\n$$\nI=\\frac12e^{2x}\\arctan\\sqrt{e^x-1}-\\frac12\\int \\frac{e^{2x}}{2\\sqrt{e^x-1}}\\,dx.\n$$\n再令 $t=\\sqrt{e^x-1}$，则 $e^x=t^2+1$，可化为有理式积分，算得\n$$\nI=\\frac12\\left[e^{2x}\\arctan\\sqrt{e^x-1}-\\frac13(\\sqrt{e^x-1})^3+\\sqrt{e^x-1}\\right]+C.\n$$", "methods": ["分部积分", "换元积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["积分方程", "微积分基本定理", "平均值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "(1) $f(x)=2a(1-e^{-x})$；\n\n(2) $a=\\dfrac e2$。", "explanation": "将第二项作换元 $u=x-t$，得\n$$\n\\int_0^x f(t)\\,dt+\\int_0^x (x-u)f(u)\\,du=ax^2.\n$$\n整理后对 $x$ 求导，可得\n$$\nf(x)+\\int_0^x f(u)\\,du=2ax.\n$$\n令\n$$\nF(x)=\\int_0^x f(u)\\,du,\n$$\n则 $F'(x)+F(x)=2ax,\\ F(0)=0$。解得\n$$\nF(x)=2ax-2a+2ae^{-x},\n$$\n故\n$$\nf(x)=F'(x)=2a(1-e^{-x}).\n$$\n再由平均值条件\n$$\n\\int_0^1 f(x)\\,dx=1\n$$\n得\n$$\n2a\\int_0^1(1-e^{-x})dx=1 \\Rightarrow \\frac{2a}{e}=1,\n$$\n所以 $a=\\dfrac e2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["参数曲线围成区域", "二重积分", "换元"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$3\\pi^2+5\\pi$", "explanation": "对竖条积分，设上边界为 $y=\\varphi(x)$，则\n$$\n\\iint_D(x+2y)\\,dxdy=\\int_0^{2\\pi}[x\\varphi(x)+\\varphi^2(x)]\\,dx.\n$$\n再用参数表示\n$$\nx=t-\\sin t,\\qquad y=1-\\cos t,\\qquad dx=(1-\\cos t)dt,\n$$\n可得\n$$\n\\iint_D(x+2y)\\,dxdy\n=\\int_0^{2\\pi}(t-\\sin t)(1-\\cos t)^2dt+\\int_0^{2\\pi}(1-\\cos t)^3dt.\n$$\n逐项积分后得到\n$$\n3\\pi^2+5\\pi.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "proof", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["函数单调性", "不等式证明", "对数函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "结论成立", "explanation": "设\n$$\nf(x)=x-\\ln^2x+2k\\ln x-1.\n$$\n只需证明 $x<1$ 时 $f(x)\\le0$，$x>1$ 时 $f(x)\\ge0$。\n\n对 $0<x<1$，有\n$$\nf'(x)=\\frac{x-2\\ln x+2k}{x}.\n$$\n再设 $g(x)=x-2\\ln x+2k$，则\n$$\ng'(x)=1-\\frac2x<0.\n$$\n所以 $g(x)>g(1)=1+2k\\ge2\\ln2-1>0$，故 $f'(x)>0$，从而 $f(x)\\le f(1)=0$。\n\n对 $x>1$ 同理，$g'(x)=1-\\dfrac2x$ 在 $(1,2)$ 上小于零、在 $(2,+\\infty)$ 上大于零，故\n$$\ng(x)\\ge g(2)=2-2\\ln2+2k\\ge0.\n$$\n因而 $f'(x)\\ge0$，故 $f(x)\\ge f(1)=0$。\n\n于是\n$$\n(x-1)f(x)\\ge0,\n$$\n即原不等式成立。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极值问题", "几何应用"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$S_{\\min}=\\dfrac{1}{\\pi+4+3\\sqrt3}$", "explanation": "设三段长度分别为 $x,y,z$，则\n$$\nx+y+z=2.\n$$\n圆、正三角形、正方形的面积分别为\n$$\n\\frac{x^2}{4\\pi},\\qquad \\frac{\\sqrt3\\,y^2}{36},\\qquad \\frac{z^2}{16}.\n$$\n故\n$$\nS=\\frac{x^2}{4\\pi}+\\frac{\\sqrt3\\,y^2}{36}+\\frac{z^2}{16}.\n$$\n这是闭有界集合上的连续函数，最小值存在。用拉格朗日乘子法：\n$$\nF=\\frac{x^2}{4\\pi}+\\frac{\\sqrt3\\,y^2}{36}+\\frac{z^2}{16}+\\lambda(x+y+z-2).\n$$\n解方程组得\n$$\nx=\\frac{4\\pi}{2\\pi+8+6\\sqrt3},\\quad\ny=\\frac{12\\sqrt3}{2\\pi+8+6\\sqrt3},\\quad\nz=\\frac{16}{2\\pi+8+6\\sqrt3}.\n$$\n代回得\n$$\nS_{\\min}=\\frac{1}{\\pi+4+3\\sqrt3}.\n$$", "methods": ["拉格朗日乘数法"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["相关变化率", "定积分面积", "导数应用"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "10", "explanation": "设 $P=(x(t),\\frac49x^2(t))$。由图形面积可得\n$$\nS(t)=\\frac12\\left(1+\\frac49x^2(t)\\right)x(t)-\\int_0^{x(t)}\\frac49u^2\\,du\n=\\frac{x(t)}{2}+\\frac{2}{27}x^3(t).\n$$\n所以\n$$\nS'(t)=\\frac12x'(t)+\\frac29x^2(t)x'(t).\n$$\n当 $x=3,\\ x'(t)=4$ 时，\n$$\nS'(t)=\\frac12\\cdot4+\\frac29\\cdot9\\cdot4=10.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q021", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 21, "question_type": "proof", "score": 11, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["数列极限", "单调有界", "递推数列"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q021.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "数列收敛，且极限为 0", "explanation": "由递推式得\n$$\nx_{n+1}=\\ln\\frac{e^{x_n}-1}{x_n}.\n$$\n因为 $x_1>0$，且对 $x>0$ 有 $e^x-1>x$，所以归纳可得 $x_n>0$。\n\n再由中值定理，\n$$\ne^{x_n}-1=e^{\\xi_n}x_n\\qquad(0<\\xi_n<x_n),\n$$\n从而\n$$\ne^{x_{n+1}}=\\frac{e^{x_n}-1}{x_n}=e^{\\xi_n},\n$$\n即 $x_{n+1}=\\xi_n<x_n$。故 $\\{x_n\\}$ 单调递减且有下界 $0$，从而收敛。\n\n设极限为 $A\\ge0$，对递推式取极限：\n$$\nAe^A=e^A-1.\n$$\n解得 $A=0$。故\n$$\n\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}x_n=0.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q022", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 22, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["二次型", "规范形", "秩与特征值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q022.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "(1) 当 $a=2$ 时，$x=k(2,1,-1)^{\\mathsf T}\\ (k\\in\\mathbb R)$；当 $a\\ne2$ 时，只有零解。\n\n(2) 当 $a=2$ 时，规范形为 $y_1^2+y_2^2$；当 $a\\ne2$ 时，规范形为 $y_1^2+y_2^2+y_3^2$。", "explanation": "由 $f=0$ 可知三个平方项都为零，即\n$$\n\\begin{cases}\nx_1-x_2+x_3=0,\\\\\nx_2+x_3=0,\\\\\nx_1+ax_3=0.\n\\end{cases}\n$$\n其系数矩阵经消元可化为上三角，最后一行给出系数 $a-2$。故当 $a\\ne2$ 时秩为 $3$，只有零解；当 $a=2$ 时秩为 $2$，通解为\n$$\nx=k(2,1,-1)^{\\mathsf T}.\n$$\n\n令\n$$\ny_1=x_1-x_2+x_3,\\quad y_2=x_2+x_3,\\quad y_3=x_1+ax_3,\n$$\n则\n$$\nf=y_1^2+y_2^2+y_3^2.\n$$\n当 $a\\ne2$ 时变换矩阵可逆，故规范形为 $y_1^2+y_2^2+y_3^2$。当 $a=2$ 时该变换矩阵秩为 $2$，此时二次型正惯性指数为 $2$、零惯性指数为 $1$，故规范形为 $y_1^2+y_2^2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018_q023", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2018", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2018, "question_number": 23, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["矩阵方程", "初等列变换", "可逆矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2018_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2018_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q023.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "(1) $a=2$；\n\n(2) 可取\n$$\nP=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n-6k_1+3&-6k_2+4&-6k_3+4\\\\\n2k_1-1&2k_2-1&2k_3-1\\\\\nk_1&k_2&k_3\n\\end{pmatrix},\n$$\n其中 $k_1,k_2,k_3\\in\\mathbb R$，且 $k_2\\ne k_3$。", "explanation": "因为 $A$ 可经初等列变换化为 $B$，故 $r(A)=r(B)$。分别对两矩阵做消元：\n$$\nA\\sim\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&2&a\\\\\n0&1&-a\\\\\n0&0&0\n\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad\nB\\sim\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&a&2\\\\\n0&1&1\\\\\n0&0&2-a\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n因秩相等，得 $2-a=0$，即 $a=2$。\n\n于是求矩阵方程 $AP=B$。把增广矩阵 $(A,B)$ 消元可得通解\n$$\nP=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n-6k_1+3&-6k_2+4&-6k_3+4\\\\\n2k_1-1&2k_2-1&2k_3-1\\\\\nk_1&k_2&k_3\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n其可逆条件为 $|P|\\ne0$，由结果可化为 $k_2\\ne k_3$。故上式即所求。", "methods": []}
